   "new_conf": 60,
   "new_status": "stable",
   "old_conf": 60,
   "old_status": "concentrating",
   "reason": "AMD's fiscal fourth quarters are now filled from its 10-Ks (they file full-year segment figures under a differently spelled member), so Q4 2025 exists. The four-quarter window now runs from 0.865 (Q2 2025) to 0.870 (Q2 2026), a move of 0.005 inside the 0.02 dead band. The concentrating reading set on 27 Sep compared across the missing quarter and no longer holds.",
